@startuml
[*] --> New User : Initial State

New User --> Registered User : Complete Registration
Registered User --> Signed In : Sign In
Signed In --> Viewing Result : View Available Facilities, Read News/Expert Content, Check Symptoms/Fitness Options
Viewing Result --> Signed In : Continue Using System
Signed In --> Payment Processing : Process and Validate Insurance
Payment Processing --> Signed In : Check Payment with Insurance
Signed In --> Payment Processing : Select Payment Method (Cash/Insurance)
Payment Processing --> Signed In : Inform About Cash Payment Details
Payment Processing --> Signed In : Complete Payment Process for Insurance
Signed In --> Feedback Collection : Provide Feedback
Signed In --> Logged Out : Finish Session, System Logs Out User

Logged Out --> [*] : Final State
@enduml
